			"Title" "Heavy Gear II Steam Deck Layout"
			"Description" "Custom control layout for Heavy Gear II. Left stick: Mech Movement (Walk/Turn). Right stick & Right Trackpad: Aim Reticle / Mouse. Right Trigger: Primary Fire. Left Trigger: Secondary / Cycle. Bumpers: Jump Jets & Weapon Cycle. Face buttons: Jump, Crouch, Target Enemy, Cycle Target. D-Pad: Throttle & Sidestep. Back Grips: Full Stop, Center Torso, Grenade, Tactical Map."
		}
	}
